{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24574","headline":"小阁闲坐 · 白居易","name":"小阁闲坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阁前竹萧萧，阁下水潺潺。\n拂簟卷帘坐，清风生其间。\n静闻新蝉鸣，远见飞鸟还。\n但有巾挂壁，而无客叩关。\n二疎返故里，四老归旧山。\n吾亦适所愿，求闲而得闲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24574.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24574","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}